  "details": "Add an option for a player to enable / disable / set to friends only whether or not they will be visible in other player’s cameras when they take pictures or stream.\n\nThis has several benefits:\n\n-Increase general privacy, adds a mechanism to opt-out of all photos.\n\n-Allows friends to take photos of you while disallowing others from taking your photo\n\n-Removes a common source of friction and trolling (especially in public instances) by preventing a primary trolling method.",
